WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.470
Say the word yoga, and many
people picture postures on a mat.

2
00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:08.330
But for Hindus, yoga
is a whole way of life.

3
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.130
The word comes from a
root meaning to join:

4
00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:13.930
the self joined with the divine.

5
00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:17.430
Now picture four people:
a nurse, a scholar,

6
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:19.630
a meditator and a singer.

7
00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.940
Can all four be on the
same spiritual path?

8
00:00:22.990 --> 00:00:26.940
In this mission, you'll explore
what each path asks of a person,

9
00:00:26.990 --> 00:00:30.630
in work, study, stillness and love.

10
00:00:30.680 --> 00:00:35.130
Then you'll see why different Hindus
disagree about which path is best.

11
00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:38.570
Your mission: find out
whether a nurse, a scholar,

12
00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:42.370
a meditator and a singer can
share one spiritual path.
